<title>USA: Goodyear Tire &amp; Rubber sets $250 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Goodyear Tire &amp; Rubber sets $250 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Goodyear Tire &amp; Rubber was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Chase Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER GOODYEAR TIRE &amp; RUBBER CO</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 6.625 PCT  MATURITY 12/01/2006</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.60   FIRST PAY DATE 06/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 6.68 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD 65 BP	MAKE-WHOLE CALL AT 10</p>
<p>						 BASIS POINTS OVER U.S.</p>
<p>						  TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit 212 859-1678</p>
